{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740840/extras/D_Demo.png?t=1754502509\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valse des Fleurs is an RPG Maker horror game that takes place in a ballet academy. You take on the role of Anya, a talented ballerina on her first day at the academy whose main goal is to perfect her dancing skills. However, as soon as Anya arrives at the school, she starts having nightmares involving witch-like figures, brainwashed students, and obscene rituals. Now she must find out whether these nightmares are only in her head... or if there is any truth to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740840/extras/D_Features.png?t=1754502509\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious witch-like figures patrolling the academy late at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A panic meter which must be kept in check for the sake of Anya's sanity</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 H-Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 playable character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tall pixel art sprites instead RPG Maker standard ones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740840/extras/D_Extra.png?t=1754502509\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740840/extras/D_Social.png?t=1754502509\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c